{"scraped_at": "2026-06-04T07:26:16.694941+00:00", "run_id": "20260604_072616", "page": 8, "api_response": {"count": 3946, "per_page": 20, "current_page": 8, "total_pages": 198, "next": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=9&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "previous": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=7&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "results": [{"review_id": 876986454, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r876986454-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinath a Sacred , Architectural and Natural beauty and holy place for cremation too..", "text": "Pashupatinath Temple Is Located in Kathmandu  about 1 Km  North East of Kathmandu Airport and 4 KM East of Touristic City called Thamel. Which is Dedicated to Lord Shiva. This is only 5 faces( East,West,North,South and Zenith) Lord Shiva's Temple in all over the world. It is Situated on the bank of Holy River Bagmati. This Temple was registered in World Heritage site in 1979. It is the Hindus's Greatest sacred Temple Where only Hindus are allowed but all the other  religious people also visit   outside of it  .As I have visited several times ,i would like to visit again and Again. Its found not only sacred place but also  attractive Art and architectural Pagoda style Temples, Natural River, Forest. Love to visit again and again.  I recommend every visitor  may visit to get its, experience.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2023-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "24526D595BED57FF0841499DC2C415EF", "name": "Hari Prasad Timilsina", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/714harit", "username": "714harit", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/17/65/04/hari-t.jpg", "contribution_count": 32, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 3374769, "location_name": "Kathmandu Valley", "location_name_detailed": "Kathmandu Valley, Nepal"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/28/11/05/b8/pashupatinath-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/28/11/06/11/eastern-view-from-across.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2023-01-31", "published_at_date": "2023-01-31"}, {"review_id": 874624802, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r874624802-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Best place to see cremation", "text": "It is one of the best place for Hindu people and impressive architecture structure of the temple on pagoda style.  it is also a place which make you more emotional while saw cremation on the bank of Bagmati river.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "E1F3E521A76E0D91825BE341F2744AA1", "name": "lynne A", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/lynnea574", "username": "lynnea574", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f2/b8/default-avatar-2020-26.jpg", "contribution_count": 1, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2023-01-10", "published_at_date": "2023-01-10"}, {"review_id": 873850399, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r873850399-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Nice holy experience", "text": "Visited in December 2022. We went to this place as part of a full day sightseeing tour. We went around 5 pm and the air was too cold. Since it is a Hindu temple, we need to remove our footwear and the cold flooring didn't help our cause. Moreover the officials were cleaning the temple with cold water. We had a good darshan (view) of the deity. We stood in line multiple times for darshan as the lines were small. We were told there will a premium line if there is crowd. As expected, the premium line has a fee. The view of deity is much better after the lights are switched on. Like in any Hindu temple, the main deity is surrounded by multiple other deities that you can walk around and pray. Like Swayambunath Temple, there are a lot of monkeys around. As long as we don't open food packets or water bottles in front of them, they will not disturb us.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "DB738E717D3652A4477017E122288C73", "name": "Gautam05", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Gautam05", "username": "Gautam05", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e8/91/default-avatar-2020-62.jpg", "contribution_count": 57, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304556, "location_name": "Chennai (Madras)", "location_name_detailed": "Chennai (Madras), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2023-01-04", "published_at_date": "2023-01-04"}, {"review_id": 873589381, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r873589381-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Jayesh Mor", "text": "Very Holy place ..it is a  place to see the trust in Mahdve-God...to know the history..millioners devotees come there to fullfill their wishes...one must see its a rare opportunity to see this beautiful temple...one can make shopping of moti and rudraksh from goverment approved stores..and to move here and there nearby temple.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1CA477B269E8B701DDDA58B0406CB263", "name": "Jayesh M", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/RamadaAmritsar", "username": "RamadaAmritsar", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/08/1c/4b/bb/ramadaamritsar.jpg", "contribution_count": 150, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297608, "location_name": "Ahmedabad", "location_name_detailed": "Ahmedabad, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2023-01-02", "published_at_date": "2023-01-02"}, {"review_id": 872576500, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r872576500-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "As usual place", "text": "One of the Famous temple in kathamandu. You should visit this place. To know more keep on eyes to our youtube channel \"Journey Adviser\".", "review_tip": null, "rating": 3, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2022-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "580BB177384B49F3F560EA63E1A8F1B0", "name": "K Niaz Morshed", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/150khandakarm", "username": "150khandakarm", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/14/74/de/80/khandakar-m.jpg", "contribution_count": 1565, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 293936, "location_name": "Dhaka City", "location_name_detailed": "Dhaka City, Bangladesh"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-12-23", "published_at_date": "2022-12-23"}, {"review_id": 871866598, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r871866598-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Interesting experience, worth checking it out.", "text": "Interesting cultural experience. We saw 3 stages of cremation concurrently. 1 body was still being cremated and the 1st son of the deceased was getting his head shaved; the second cremation station was just done and the caretaker was cleaning up the site by sweeping the ashes into the river; the 3rd cremation station was just getting started. Overall, an interesting temple to visit to learn about Hinduism & Nepal’s belief in after-death. \n\nBe careful of the touts and “guides” who naturally tag along beside you and suddenly became your official guides. Do stop them if you are not keen or negotiate a price before the “guides” start their grand tour. Otherwise, it will be a usd50 affair for a short tour of 1hr or so. Having said that, the “guide” was quite informative.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2022-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "9369AA317FFB57AF6C657A69EC38B32E", "name": "Wen A", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Powerpuff_Gal", "username": "Powerpuff_Gal", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/3c/fa/40/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 68, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 294265, "location_name": "Singapore", "location_name_detailed": "Singapore, Singapore"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/27/67/7e/10/caption.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/27/67/7e/11/caption.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2022-12-16", "published_at_date": "2022-12-16"}, {"review_id": 871581864, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r871581864-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "what an experience", "text": "A wish that was long pending\nHad a pandit come with us and offer darshan and puja \nHe acted like a guide and said which one was important.\nImmense energy was fely from the sanctum Sanctorum.\nAn experience to remember throughout my life", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-12-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "E94DF7BC4206AD13A5B9405CDF8FA584", "name": "Ganesh Srinivasan", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Happy2travel4any", "username": "Happy2travel4any", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/eb/6d/default-avatar-2020-19.jpg", "contribution_count": 3, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297654, "location_name": "Pune", "location_name_detailed": "Pune, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-12-13", "published_at_date": "2022-12-13"}, {"review_id": 868569686, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r868569686-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinath Temple", "text": "A large religious site with Pashupatinath Temple adjacent to the river. Cremations take place here. Lots of street peddlars and beggars.  Entry NRs 1000 pp. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 2, "subratings": [], "like_count": 3, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "1517E9D307FBCF9ADEBD571F7E4D0072", "name": "downhillcyclist", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/downhillcyclist", "username": "downhillcyclist", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e9/bb/default-avatar-2020-65.jpg", "contribution_count": 465, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186216, "location_name": "United Kingdom", "location_name_detailed": "United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-11-15", "published_at_date": "2022-11-15"}, {"review_id": 866018818, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r866018818-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Interesting Cremation Temple", "text": "you can see from the opposite sides, the process when the departed arrives since all the family & relatives give their last prayer before cremation.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "A0BE36749AF1D759CADACB1165A0D041", "name": "SUNU PO", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/sunupobali", "username": "sunupobali", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/eb/a3/default-avatar-2020-38.jpg", "contribution_count": 13, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-10-26", "published_at_date": "2022-10-26"}, {"review_id": 865855057, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r865855057-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Peaceful place", "text": "This is an interesting place to visit while in Nepal. I learned a lot about Hindu culture and especially how they honor the last day of their beloved who passed away. They have to perform certain rituals before they’re cremated. Loved ones are there and assisting to finalize the cremation. People can watch from the other side of the river. The temple is a beautiful site, I think it’s perfect for the ones who are gone.  I say bring a mask if you can’t stand the scent of the smoke. Prayers to all who passed.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "DBFF36838DDB13824D5B715920A709AC", "name": "annminky", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/annminky", "username": "annminky", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/14/54/91/45/annminky.jpg", "contribution_count": 4126, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 191, "location_name": "United States", "location_name_detailed": "United States"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/26/ac/cd/47/caption.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/26/ac/cd/48/caption.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/26/ac/cd/49/caption.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2022-10-25", "published_at_date": "2022-10-25"}, {"review_id": 864997755, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r864997755-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Old Best Hindu temple", "text": "Best place nearby international airport Hindu temple old temple and you can see cremation of Hindu culture \nBest for history culture and religion.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "39E6183AACBBFFC9C396DC66EBD3B56E", "name": "Gunti", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Passenger29287676016", "username": "Passenger29287676016", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/26/97/65/47/passenger29287676016.jpg", "contribution_count": 8, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255057, "location_name": "Canberra", "location_name_detailed": "Canberra, Australia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-10-18", "published_at_date": "2022-10-18"}, {"review_id": 864921235, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r864921235-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinath visit in October 2022", "text": "Pashupatinath temple is among the 12 jyotirlinga.  Beautiful temple and must visit if you are in Kathmandu.  As the temple opens at around 4am best time is to visit at that time as it is completely empty. It closes at 7pm that is after the aarti. After 6am it starts getting crowded.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "056D86F76E0AC2F1F0C0F823AB43B7AF", "name": "Sanjay", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/564sanja", "username": "564sanja", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1f/73/13/5b/564sanja.jpg", "contribution_count": 167, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304558, "location_name": "Kolkata (Calcutta)", "location_name_detailed": "Kolkata (Calcutta), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-10-17", "published_at_date": "2022-10-17"}, {"review_id": 864859480, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r864859480-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "One of the finest temples of Lord Shiva", "text": "We went there twice on our trip. The first time due to a heavy rush on Monday we could not have proper darshan of Mahadev but compensated that with a beautiful darshan on Friday morning. Please be aware that there are huge crowds on Monday and Saturday so prepare accordingly. Also the temple remains closed in the afternoon from 12-5 and is open in the evening only from 5-6.30. Also  be careful of the monkeys. But do visit the other small temples near the main shrine. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "5DB3C5FB75F7EB06896E73E6A1757C66", "name": "tarit1979", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/tarit1979", "username": "tarit1979", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f4/d0/default-avatar-2020-33.jpg", "contribution_count": 231, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297615, "location_name": "Gurugram (Gurgaon)", "location_name_detailed": "Gurugram (Gurgaon), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-10-17", "published_at_date": "2022-10-17"}, {"review_id": 864694092, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r864694092-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "The Great HINDU Temple", "text": "Wonderful holy temple in Kathmandu - just a mile away from the Airport and gets crowded many times during peak morning and evening hours.\n\nHave been visiting the temple year after year and the glory of the deity and the premises is intact.\n\nCleanliness needs some improvement.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "3C0F5647949F45269AF73CBE667F3D0E", "name": "Yogesh L", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/YogeshLad", "username": "YogeshLad", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/2a/3d/bf/a0/yogesh-l.jpg", "contribution_count": 761, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297654, "location_name": "Pune", "location_name_detailed": "Pune, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-10-16", "published_at_date": "2022-10-16"}, {"review_id": 863802284, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r863802284-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Solo female foreign travellers be aware", "text": "Sadly did not get to have a look.\nWas dropped off by a lovely taxi, then proceeded to be followed by 4 men. As a foreign, solo 50yo female tourist I had to take evasive action to keep myself and my belongings safe. It is locally known of bag theft, pick pocketing (found out afterwards). Lucky some Hindu ladies seen how distressed I was and stayed with me until a taxi came. \nFrom discussions with locals it is common but goes unreported.\nIn my experience I would NOT recommend females to visit here alone.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 1, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2022-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "510FA3ED62895C5755C85A94485CF31D", "name": "MEG", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/MRSMEGGY", "username": "MRSMEGGY", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/26/69/0f/45/cruiser393116.jpg", "contribution_count": 3, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2022-10-09", "published_at_date": "2022-10-10"}, {"